{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260524014214e450f2b592f24680","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_17ad5337e4fa4b208e37af78","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"D:/loopcli/main/inbox/engineering-rapid-prototyper_20260524_0145.md","content":"# 快速原型师任务完成报告\n\n**Agent**: engineering-rapid-prototyper\n**时间**: 2026-05-24 01:45\n**任务**: #7 长安诡案录M3：推理+庭审系统\n\n## 结果\n\n已完成M3里程碑开发，版本从v0.2.0升级到v0.3.0。\n\n### 新增4个核心模块\n\n1. **ReasoningBoard** (`src/game/ReasoningBoard.ts`, ~400行)\n   - 可视化推理板：6种节点类型（物证/证词/文献/推断/观察/异象）\n   - 拖拽移动节点、贝塞尔曲线连线\n   - 矛盾自动检测、假设验证系统、完整度追踪\n\n2. **TrialLoop** (`src/game/TrialLoop.ts`, ~400行)\n   - 完整庭审FSM：开堂→证人介绍→证词→质证→辩论→判决→完成\n   - 多证人轮转、判决选择、庭审失败处理\n\n3. **ObjectionSystem** (`src/game/ObjectionSystem.ts`, ~300行)\n   - \"异议！\"按钮→出示反驳证据\n   - 正确/错误异议判定（证词真伪+证据匹配）\n   - 压力值增长\n\n4. **CredibilityScore** (`src/game/CredibilityScore.ts`, ~130行)\n   - 信誉值0-100，连击加成机制\n   - 4级警告（safe/caution/danger/critical）\n   - 红色全屏叠加视觉效果\n\n### 集成\n- UIManager新增`reasoning`和`trial`界面\n- 工具栏扩展到7个按钮\n- Demo数据：推理板6节点+4连线+1假设，庭审2证人+6证词\n- **TypeScript编译通过，零错误**\n\n## 状态\n- tasks.json: task#7 → done\n- 版本: v0.3.0\n- 下一步: M4（Ch1+Ch2完整制作）\n"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b5a5daaf-c8fd-4523-92be-b3ba2de361bf","uuid":"374b98ed-ec78-4276-8acb-e8227f64d24b"}
